<!--
  每日一笑馆馆名小面板：立在馆门外来客一侧。文案（本阶段定版）：
  馆名 + 英文名 + 一句引子——语气与音乐亭、长椅面板同调：只邀
  请，不催促。纯展示面板，无按钮；排版沿用 music 面板的量级。
-->
<style>
  .comedy-name-root {
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 520px;
  }

  .comedy-name-content {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    padding-top: 22px;
    padding-bottom: 22px;
    padding-left: 26px;
    padding-right: 26px;
  }

  .comedy-name-line {
    color: #1c1d20;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 40px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .comedy-name-line:dark {
    color: #fafaf7;
  }

  .comedy-name-sub {
    color: #3a3b40;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .comedy-name-sub:dark {
    color: #c9c4b4;
  }

  .comedy-name-intro {
    color: #6a675c;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 18px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .comedy-name-intro:dark {
    color: #9d988a;
  }
</style>
<Panel class="comedy-name-root">
  <div class="comedy-name-content">
    <div class="comedy-name-line">每日一笑馆</div>
    <div class="comedy-name-sub">The Daily Laughter Hall</div>
    <div class="comedy-name-intro">咱们做过的笑话都在这里，进来坐，慢慢看。All the jokes we've made live here — come in, sit, take your time.</div>
  </div>
</Panel>
